ading-mobile-large sm:heading-tablet-xlarge lg:desktop-heading-large text-neutral-950 mt-16 mb-4 font-medium! [\u0026_b]:font-medium! [\u0026_strong]:font-medium!\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"7. DEMONSTRATION OF COMPLIANCE / AUDIT RIGHTS\"}]}]\n57:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed last:mb-0\",\"children\":\"We will make all information reasonably necessary to demonstrate compliance with this DPA available to you and allow for and contribute to audits, including inspections conducted by you or your auditor in order to assess compliance with this DPA, where required by applicable law. You acknowledge and agree that you will exercise your audit rights under this DPA by instructing us to comply with the audit measures described in this ‘Demonstration of Compliance’ section.\"}]\n58:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed last:mb-0\",\"children\":\"At your written r"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"equest, we will provide written responses (on a confidential basis) to all reasonable requests for information made by you necessary to confirm our compliance with this DPA, provided that you will not exercise this right more than once per calendar year unless you have reasonable grounds to suspect non-compliance with the DPA. Where permitted by law, we may instead make available to you a summary of the results of a third-party audit or certification reports relevant to our compliance with this DPA.\"}]\n59:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed last:mb-0\",\"children\":\"You will reimburse us for the commercially reasonable costs arising from any audit that is not (a) required by applicable Data Protection Laws or (b) in response to a Personal Data Breach.\"}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed last:mb-0\",\"children\":\"Artisan maintains a SOC 2 Type II report for its security controls. Upon Customer's written request, no more than once annually, Artisan will provide its then-current SOC 2 Type II report or executive summary under NDA, or, where a current report is not yet available for a particular Service or infrastructure component, a bridge letter or equivalent attestation from Artisan's auditor.\"}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"id\":\"additional_provisions_for_california_personal_information\",\"className\":\"heading-mobile-large sm:heading-tablet-xlarge lg:desktop-heading-large text-neutral-950 mt-16 mb-4 font-medium! [\u0026_b]:font-medium! [\u0026_strong]:font-medium!\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"8. ADDITIONAL PROVISIONS FOR CALIFORNIA PERSONAL INFORMATION\"}]}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"a._scope\",\"className\":\"heading-mobile-medium sm:heading-tablet-large lg:desktop-heading-medium text-neutral-950 mt-16 mb-4 font-medium! [\u0026_b]:font-medium! [\u0026_strong]:font-medium!\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"a. Scope\"}]}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed last:mb-0\",\"children\":\"The ‘Additional Provisions for California Personal Information’ section of the DPA will apply only with respect to California Personal Information.\"}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"b._roles_of_the_parties\",\"className\":\"heading-mobile-medium sm:heading-tablet-large lg:desktop-heading-medium text-neutral-950 mt-16 mb-4 font-medium! [\u0026_b]:font-medium! [\u0026_strong]:font-medium!\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"b. Roles of the Parties\"}]}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed last:mb-0\",\"children\":\"When processing California Personal Information in accordance with your Instructions, the parties acknowledge and agree that you are a Business and we are a Service Provider for the purposes of the CCPA.\"}]\n60:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"c._responsibilities\",\"className\":\"heading-mobile-medium sm:heading-tablet-large lg:desktop-heading-medium text-neutral-950 mt-16 mb-4 font-medium! [\u0026_b]:font-medium! [\u0026_strong]:font-medium!\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"c. Responsibilities\"}]}]\n61:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed last:mb-0\",\"children\":\"We certify that we will Process California Personal Information as a Service Provider strictly for the purpose of performing the Subscription Services and Consulting Services under the Agreement (the \\\"Business Purpose\\\") or as otherwise permitted by the CCPA, including as described in the ‘Usage Data’ section of our Privacy Policy. Further, we certify we i) will not Sell or Share California Personal Information; (ii) will not Process California Personal Information outside the direct business relationship between the parties, unless required by applicable law; and (iii) will not combine the California Personal Information included in Customer Data with personal information that we collect or receive from another source (other than information we receive from"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," another source in connection with our obligations as a Service Provider under the Agreement and as allowed under 11 CCR § 7052(b)).\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"d._compliance\",\"className\":\"heading-mobile-medium sm:heading-tablet-large lg:desktop-heading-medium text-neutral-950 mt-16 mb-4 font-medium! [\u0026_b]:font-medium! [\u0026_strong]:font-medium!\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"d. Compliance\"}]}]\n63:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"desktop-body-large-blog mb-4 text-neutra